WEBVTT

00:05:28.657 --> 00:05:31.786
In the Samburu region of northern Kenya,

00:05:31.786 --> 00:05:37.541
there's still little separation between
people and wildlife and livestock.

00:05:37.583 --> 00:05:41.087
Here, you can still hear
the cow bells clanging

00:05:41.087 --> 00:05:46.509
as a little boy brings his goats to water
on the mighty Ewaso Ng’iro river.

00:05:46.550 --> 00:05:50.471
And behind him, nibbling
on the tops of trees, are giraffes.

00:05:50.513 --> 00:05:54.016
And behind that, the rumble of elephants.

00:05:54.767 --> 00:05:58.896
It is here that I have found a group
of people who are pushing back

00:05:58.896 --> 00:06:02.608
on that narrative that excludes us
and tells us that we're not fit to lead